  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2019-06-29** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 178 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the mix gives Jeff notable prominence and lets the interplay among the band members come through; Reviewer describes a spacious, clear recording with a strong stereo image and enough audience ambiance to feel present at the show [2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper set up in Box 49 at Cellairis Amphitheatre; a 6-year-old girl at her first Dead show helped start and stop the recorder [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2019-06-29**: source: Neumann 150’s > V-3 > Sound Devices 722 24/96 [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann 150 microphones into a V-3 preamp, then a Sound Devices 722 at 24-bit/96kHz [1]",
